Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.菲卡)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 做最后的收尾吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭星光界最后的收尾……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)最后的收尾？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.53,0:00:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭星光界到底是怎么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很简单。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们就成为毁灭星光界的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}子弹吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这球形力场炮里。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}子弹？球形力场炮？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.11,0:00:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)游马 往下看。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这里是……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候的垃圾处理场！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来你们要去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是球形力场炮的发射口！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而它朝着星光界。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.98,0:00:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《原来如此……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.22,0:00:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这段记忆是我的世界……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和至今为止的攻击不是一个级别。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 这个球形力场是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.42,0:01:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 No.众的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凝聚成一体的子弹。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其一口气发射出去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.27,0:01:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界就会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)隼人！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隼人在哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.93,0:01:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道！ 搜索隼人的行踪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}立刻！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)知 知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.85,0:01:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了那种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了那种事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然对快斗使用 No.众！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗狂欢节也 No.众也
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.47,0:01:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了收集它们才举办的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.38,0:01:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特败给拜隆这件事虽然很遗憾{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但 那也在预想范围之内。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要所有 No.卡都聚集到决赛{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.25,0:02:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的目的就能达成。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么说来我和特隆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有凯特和鲨鱼再加上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们所有参赛者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都只是你的工具吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…… 开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时机即将成熟。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 哈尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是你最后的工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.24,0:02:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没弄错吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特大人 就在这座塔的下方。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在地下的垃圾处理场。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他没事吧。哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然平安无事……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特大人在那个地方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特大人自身
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为了球形力场炮的一部分……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特 哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂哈鲁特！ 哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 哈鲁特啊由你自身作为扳机{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭阿斯特拉尔世界吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.53,0:03:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特是扳机？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 No.者的能量作为子弹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后用哈鲁特的力量将其发射出去吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很快就能实现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.85,0:03:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭阿斯特拉尔世界获得巴里安的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支配这个世界这夙愿！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)大家！没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 小鸟呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来没看到人影啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)难道说…把游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明里小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)大家 都没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马那家伙和场地一起消失了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 小鸟也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.69,0:05:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)怎… 怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯… 这 这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:05:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}借助哈尔特的力量得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在痛苦吗 哈尔特…！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.51,0:06:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.费卡)很好。就是这个势头，春人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.79,0:06:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光世界的崩坏正在逼近。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的野心实现的瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正一刻一刻地临近。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.19,0:06:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.95,0:06:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听得见吗？小鸟酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回句话啊…小鸟酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器](小鸟)明里小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟酱…太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.23,0:06:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没事啊，现在在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在在心之塔的下面。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]心之塔…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么会在那种地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马一定就在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.41,0:07:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人…快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]明里小姐，对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我待会儿再打给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？等等，小鸟酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟酱……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马……你在哪，你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.81,0:07:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……那是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来，再用点力！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡……卡片化！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再差一点，加油……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是那时候的……！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.89,0:07:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来撑住方舟。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.79,0:07:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}趁这期间把那家伙拽出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.71,0:07:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……好。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你，夏克。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧和那家伙一起逃吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)我不能逃……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.53,0:08:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，哈鲁特他……！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎……哈鲁特他！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.59,0:08:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥比塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，回答我。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快回答！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特到底怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实……他成了球体·领域炮的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一部分。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.87,0:08:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}球体·领域炮！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)那是为了毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星界世界而制造的最终兵器。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡博士为了完成它{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让凯特大人收集 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能量……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它在哪里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}球形力场炮从哪里发射！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没时间了……走了，欧比塔尔……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！话还没说完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不是说过不需要道谢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不巧，我可没有什么感谢的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}期待也是白费。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.27,0:09:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，是来提出决斗的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个也先往后放放吧。不过，和你之间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该早就分出胜负了才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！下次轮到我来我绝对要赢给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们两个在干什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在不是做这种事的时候吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我既不是想要什么回报{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不是想和这家伙决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是想救游马而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在球形力场里面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙可能还在。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是就那样被变成兵器的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:10:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能眼睁睁看着游马去死！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}代替我打倒了特隆的那个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回答我，你这破机器人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}球形力场炮是从哪里发射的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}臭机器人是什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对说这种话的家伙 我绝对不会告诉你！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 我也想救游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然 还有隼人！ 游马也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直 都在担心隼人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这件事 你自己也应该明白的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((游马：可是我已经和隼人约好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁来保护隼人啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我去隼人那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由我来保护隼人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 集中精力决斗！))
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 拜托了。为了救那两个人 借给我力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧 欧比塔尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡西科马里！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想救的话 就跟上来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在地下的 垃圾处理场隼人和游马都在。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垃圾处理场……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那个地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身体好沉。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.55,0:11:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行了……站都站不住。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是我的错。我的力量正在衰退。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.90,0:11:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……至少只有你一个人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想救你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别说傻话。怎么可能把你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丢下不管啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你……还有隼人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家要一起得救！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我直到最后都绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超热血沸腾啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)不行。通往地下的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被完全堵住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.68,0:11:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没有其他路了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去查，欧比塔尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.62,0:11:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽这么说可眼下这情况{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连不上主机电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没法确定地点……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你办不到吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个没用的破机器人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那这样你来想办法啊，你这个毛球男！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！ 找明里姐的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听得见吗？ 小鸟酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]从你现在的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}往左三个街区有楼梯哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]从那里可以下到地下！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是明里姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.33,0:12:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢 帮大忙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 别太勉强自己哦。小心点啊 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)说到底能依靠的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就只有小鸟了游马就拜托你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的心情也是一样的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 到这边来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我知道。为了大家我也绝对要救他！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 一定要平安啊 游马！》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.07,0:13:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前面就是哈尔特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是来了啊 海斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.83,0:13:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弟弟的呼喊声你听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.91,0:13:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特！哈尔特～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…游马也在！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妨碍Dr.费卡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是谁我都不会放过。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 动手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把碍事的家伙排除掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小机器人)打扫 打扫……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迎击 轨道！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看我来干一场！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.91,0:14:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原谅我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 挺有一套干得不错！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别光顾着佩服你 给我再加把劲！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明 明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小机器人)垃圾 垃圾……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…… 没完没了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.65,0:14:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去 小春就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.69,0:15:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.哈特兰德)不必担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小春会很有用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身为父亲因为这是为了Dr.菲卡好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他一定也会如愿以偿吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没有在开玩笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很高兴啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.哈特兰德)Dr.菲卡长年的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即将实现这件事！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也关系到我的梦想！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我为了Dr.菲卡大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赌上了一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为如此 我绝不允许任何人来妨碍！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们也和那个九十九游马一起消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 地狱之门 打开吧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.78,0:15:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)什 什么啊 到底……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下面通往星光界。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你们永别了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙 把我们当成垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算把我们也一样丢掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦掉进那个洞里就……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很快哈鲁特就会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为球形力场炮的扳机。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由此这位父亲的梦想 心愿{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.59,0:16:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的愿望都将化为现实！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 把那些家伙打下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(机器人们)垃圾 垃圾……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 越来越多冒出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 臭机器人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙你就没办法搞定吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说 臭机器人是什么意思啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:16:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这不良混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在不是吵架的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些机器人应该是从某处
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接收到指令在行动的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要查明那个并破坏掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么这么简单的事……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，赶紧去查一查吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.23,0:17:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的指令都是从主机电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要强行访问那里然后施加大量电压的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到了，就在那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用解释了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不快点动手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别命令我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.97,0:17:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺可不是你的仆人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊，欧比塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡、卡西科马里！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧比塔尔步！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是卡西科马林克哒，俺！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且一直都是俺的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，就给主机电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}施加超过容量的电压……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.53,0:17:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Orbital！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.55,0:18:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙的动作停下来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.94,0:18:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不、不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Haluto的能量值在不断下降！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！怎……怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等……等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来人啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁来帮帮我啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Orbital！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.57,0:18:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好，Orbital！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请容我代Kite大人转达赞美之词……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我的荣幸……之至。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Orbital……谢谢你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？发生什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.26,0:18:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！Shark！Kite！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:18:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么那些家伙会在这里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Sphere Field的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在减弱。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的话 说不定…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 解开ZEXAL吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.39,0:19:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.90,0:19:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的话 只有你能逃出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.87,0:19:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在 说什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.13,0:19:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也一起 逃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 做不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.30,0:19:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.05,0:19:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能在这个星光界里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能存在了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 我就是 No.本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.66,0:19:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.22,0:19:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:19:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光，你……！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.27,0:20:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去救小遥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.25,0:20:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去拯救星光世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来就托付给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.65,0:20:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你可真是多管闲事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.21,0:20:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，不管你做什么都是徒劳的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再过不久，你们就会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.27,0:20:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和星光世界一起被炸飞。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被那球形力场炮轰得粉碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡博士！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.07,0:20:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此……是这么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明白了，星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.56,0:21:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把力量借给我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是星光托付给我的守护希望与未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.53,0:21:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望与未来？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《你也把它托付给我吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望与未来……》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的心已经决定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赌上大家的未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用决斗来一决胜负吧，Dr.费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.03,0:21:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在电脑自动修复完成之前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.50,0:21:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用来打发时间正合适。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也得让你还回来才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.10,0:21:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧，我就当你的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马、快斗、鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们才是大家的希望{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.40,0:22:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来！》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.73,0:23:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.62,0:23:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:23:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.61,0:23:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.42,0:23:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.48,0:23:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.25,0:24:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.87,0:24:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.18,0:24:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡，决战的时刻到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.59,0:24:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.84,0:24:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们也来了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.94,0:24:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千万别拖我后腿啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.11,0:24:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么看拖后腿的都是你吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.63,0:24:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是说这个啊？

